{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\eng\\072.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Vocabulary", "conf": 0.879, "box": [[251, 234], [552, 216], [556, 269], [254, 287]]}, {"text": "Listen to the weather forecast report carefully and choose the correct", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[225, 351], [1315, 250], [1319, 296], [229, 397]]}, {"text": "meaning for the following words:", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[226, 402], [742, 360], [745, 396], [229, 438]]}, {"text": "i)", "conf": 0.641, "box": [[226, 452], [251, 452], [251, 484], [226, 484]]}, {"text": "Isolated showers:", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[276, 446], [529, 427], [532, 460], [278, 479]]}, {"text": "a) rainfall occurring in many areas.", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[281, 492], [773, 458], [776, 494], [283, 528]]}, {"text": "b) rainfall happening in a few areas.", "conf": 0.874, "box": [[278, 540], [793, 503], [796, 542], [281, 579]]}, {"text": "eesevices", "conf": 0.838, "box": [[1536, 584], [1593, 585], [1589, 1002], [1531, 1002]]}, {"text": "i)  Coastal areas:", "conf": 0.881, "box": [[218, 640], [476, 623], [478, 661], [220, 677]]}, {"text": "a) regions near mountains.", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[278, 686], [661, 660], [663, 697], [280, 723]]}, {"text": "b) regions near the sea or ocean.", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[276, 734], [752, 703], [754, 740], [278, 771]]}, {"text": "ili) Gentle breeze:", "conf": 0.86, "box": [[216, 831], [486, 818], [488, 854], [218, 867]]}, {"text": "a) strong wind.", "conf": 0.798, "box": [[273, 879], [489, 865], [491, 902], [275, 916]]}, {"text": "b) light wind.", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[271, 926], [462, 916], [464, 953], [273, 963]]}, {"text": "iv) Scattered showers:", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[209, 1024], [545, 1009], [547, 1047], [211, 1063]]}, {"text": "a) continuous rainfall.", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[271, 1074], [580, 1055], [582, 1088], [273, 1106]]}, {"text": "b) rainfall occurring in scattered or random areas.", "conf": 0.938, "box": [[270, 1119], [983, 1084], [985, 1120], [272, 1155]]}, {"text": "Let'sTalk", "conf": 0.839, "box": [[233, 1241], [376, 1234], [377, 1272], [235, 1279]]}, {"text": "In groups, discuss the given questions:", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[223, 1308], [817, 1284], [818, 1321], [225, 1345]]}, {"text": "Have your region or country ever experienced a weather-related disaster like floods o", "conf": 0.942, "box": [[271, 1346], [1551, 1299], [1553, 1348], [273, 1395]]}, {"text": "extreme heat wave? If yes, what happened and how much damage was caused?", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[276, 1402], [1455, 1358], [1457, 1395], [278, 1439]]}, {"text": "Do you remember the first time you saw snow or a hailstorm? If a snow/hailstorm is", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[273, 1449], [1520, 1406], [1521, 1444], [275, 1488]]}, {"text": "common in your area, how do you feel about it? Prepare a short descriptive talk and", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[275, 1497], [1523, 1458], [1524, 1497], [276, 1536]]}, {"text": "share it with the whole class.", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[277, 1548], [682, 1536], [683, 1569], [278, 1581]]}, {"text": "3.", "conf": 0.595, "box": [[221, 1601], [246, 1601], [246, 1628], [221, 1628]]}, {"text": "Do you worry about global warming? How is your country affected by it? What", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[273, 1596], [1440, 1563], [1441, 1602], [274, 1635]]}, {"text": "measures should be taken to overcome this challenge?", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[273, 1642], [1062, 1625], [1063, 1664], [274, 1680]]}, {"text": "67", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[829, 1975], [877, 1975], [877, 2016], [829, 2016]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.883, "box": [[896, 2014], [1144, 2014], [1144, 2050], [896, 2050]]}]}